{
  "slug": "chipotle-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Chipotle chicken salad",
  "description": "Seared chicken breast rubbed with chili powder and ground cumin, sliced over spinach with black beans, bell pepper, tomato and avocado, dressed with olive oil and lime.",
  "iconKey": "salad",
  "instructions": [
    "Season the chicken breast all over with the chili powder, ground cumin and salt.",
    "Sear the chicken in half the olive oil over medium-high heat, 6 to 7 minutes per side, then rest it and slice it thin.",
    "Toss the spinach with the remaining olive oil and a squeeze of the lime.",
    "Add the black beans, bell pepper, tomato and avocado, then fold everything together gently.",
    "Top the salad with the sliced chicken and serve."
